---
description: >-
  One representative railroad diagram in the redux family's `redux` theme. IR (`railroad-beta`): a five-way choice, an optional, zeroOrMore and oneOrMore loops, nested sequences, terminals, nonterminals and a special.
config:
  theme: redux
---
railroad-beta
value = choice(nonterminal("object"), nonterminal("array"), nonterminal("number"), terminal("true"), terminal("null")) ;
object = sequence(terminal("{"), optional(sequence(nonterminal("member"), zeroOrMore(sequence(terminal(","), nonterminal("member"))))), terminal("}")) ;
number = sequence(optional(terminal("-")), oneOrMore(special("digit"))) ;
